   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation 8 V&#xE9;rifications de d&#xE9;penses des 3 Devis Programmes (2021/427-738 PAFAE, 2019/404-965 PALOP, 2021/425-279 GAON) r&#xE9;parties en 4 Missions</narrative>
